378 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 291 0 R
/E (The targeted audiences are longtime donors who are seeking measurable impact from their contributions, as well as food shelf owners and organizers who are looking for efficient, effective support to enhance their operations. According to post-consultation surveys, food shelves indicate appreciation for FFEN's recommendations, though implementation varies due to internal challenges or timing issues. Donors are generally supportive but desire clearer reporting on outcomes and impact.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
379 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 291 0 R
/E (We want food shelves to view FFEN as a collaborative partner that can enhance their capacity to serve communities effectively. We would like donors to recognize FFEN as a reliable and effective organization that helps make their donations go further.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
380 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 291 0 R
/E (The "Set Sail to Serve Others" campaign uses a nautical theme to resonate with Minnesota's cultural identity and FFEN's mission of guiding food shelves toward improved service experiences. The campaign will utilize a mix of print ads, social media content, email, and PR and promotional materials to convey FFEN's role and impact.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
381 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 291 0 R
/E (The key messages from this campaign are that FFEN is a vital partner in the Minnesota food ecosystem, enhancing the effectiveness of food shelves across the state. Through strategic support and volunteer engagement, FFEN ensures that every dollar and effort goes further by serving communities.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
382 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 291 0 R
/E (To ensure the campaign is meeting its goals, success will be measured by tracking impressions, website traffic, social media engagement, and donation behavior to evaluate its impact and optimize content strategies.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
