/P 293 0 R
/E (Insights come from surveys completed after working with FFEN. Many shelves speak positively about what they have implemented. However, some appreciate the consultation suggestions but do not implement them because of concerns about internal readiness and strategic timing. Additional feedback comes from emails, training video comments, one-on-one conversations and virtual chats. Food shelf staff and organizers are primarily active on Facebook.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
414 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 293 0 R
/E (Donors tend to be more business-minded and focused on how their money is spent. They are primarily active on LinkedIn, though engagement is relatively low. Insights can be gathered from emails, platform interactions and stakeholder interviews. Donors are generally supportive but seek clearer reporting on impact and outcomes.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
