/Title (Abby Bremel I am a senior majoring in finance with minors in real estate and strategic communication with a focus on advertising and public relations. I originally chose to come to St. Thomas because I was recruited to play tennis. I played on the tennis team here at St. Thomas for my first two years, but I always knew that I wanted to study abroad while in college. I studied abroad in Barcelona, Spain, for a semester during the fall of my junior year. I am graduating this month and moving to Madison, Wisconsin. After graduation, I hope to start my career in finance. I love to play and watch sports with my family and friends)
